## Workflow

- The default branch contains working code.
- Commit messages should follow the [Conventional Commits specification](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/), using the organization's [commit message template](https://github.com/{{ org_login }}/.github/blob/HEAD/.gitmessage).
- Issues are opened through the forms of the repository: **Task** for a feature, an analysis or a change of documentation, **Bug** for a behavior that differs from the expected one.

> [!TIP]
> To enable the template, download it and register it once:
> ```bash
> git config --global commit.template ~/.gitmessage
> ```

